# SwitchX Pro ⚡
> Universal AI Subscription Account Switcher & Rolling Quota Router for Claude Code, Google Antigravity, Cursor, and GitHub Copilot/Codex.

[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT%20OR%20Apache--2.0-blue.svg)](LICENSE)
