## Why SwitchX?

Existing account switchers (like `venomchampion/antigravity-account-switcher`) are locked into a single VS Code webview, crash during heavy polling, and only handle Google Antigravity.

Developers pay for **Claude Pro/Team ($20/mo)**, **GitHub Copilot ($10-$20/mo)**, and **Google Antigravity/Gemini subscriptions**. When you hit rate limits, logging out and doing browser OAuth takes several minutes and disrupts your workflow.

**SwitchX** is an ultra-fast, cross-platform engine written in **Rust** with native editor and CLI integration:
- 🚀 **<10ms Instant Session Swapping** via DPAPI and atomic filesystem profiles.
- ⏱️ **Dual Rolling Window Quota Engine**: Tracks the **5-Hour sprint window** and **7-Day marathon limit** with live second-by-second countdowns.
- ⚡ **Auto-Failover (`auto-next`)**: Automatically detects exhausted capacity and routes your active session to the alt account with the highest quota.
- 💻 **Cross-Tool Runner**: Run CLIs isolated with specific profiles: `switchx run claude work -- claude`.
- 🎨 **Sleek Extension Webview**: Modern dark glassmorphism dashboard in the Activity Bar.

---

## Supported Developer Tools

| Tool / CLI | Supported Auth Model | Auto-Failover |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Claude Code CLI (`claude`)** | Anthropic Web OAuth & Subscription Profiles | ✅ Yes |
| **Google Antigravity Standalone IDE** | Google OAuth Sessions (`state.vscdb`) | ✅ Yes |
| **Cursor & Windsurf IDE** | Cursor Machine & User Sessions | ✅ Yes |
| **GitHub Copilot & Codex** | GitHub OAuth Multi-Tenant (`hosts.json`) | ✅ Yes |

---

## Installation

### Via Cargo
```bash
cargo install switchx
```

### Via NPX
```bash
npx switchx status
```

### Via Open-VSX / VS Code
Search for `SwitchX Pro` in Open VSX or install the `.vsix` package.

---

## CLI Usage

```bash
# Register subscription accounts
switchx add claude work --email "work@corp.com"
switchx add claude personal --email "me@gmail.com"
switchx add antigravity primary --email "dev@gmail.com"

# View status matrix and quota countdowns
switchx status

# Switch account manually
switchx switch claude work

# Auto-switch to the account with maximum quota
switchx auto-next claude

# Run Claude Code isolated with work profile
switchx run claude work -- claude
```

